<view class="page">
    <view class="hero">
        <text class="eyebrow">记一个字</text>
        <text class="title">把查到的位置留住，或解一串减字码</text>
        <text class="subtitle">位置来自「查音位」页的「记下」；减字码形如 <text class="mono">ad9g4</text>、<text class="mono">sg3</text>、<text class="mono">ad9g4:8.</text>。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
        <view class="card-head">
            <text class="section-title">记下的位置</text>
            <text wx:if="{{recorded.length > 0}}" class="link" bindtap="clearRecorded">清空</text>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{recorded.length === 0}}" class="state-box">
            <text class="state-text">还没有记下任何位置。</text>
            <text class="state-text">去「查音位」敲一个音，点卡片右边的「记下」。</text>
        </view>

        <view wx:for="{{recorded}}" wx:key="key" class="cand">
            <view class="cand-main">
                <text class="cand-line">{{item.toneType}} · {{item.stringText}}{{item.huiText}}</text>
                <text class="cand-sub">
                    <text wx:if="{{item.leftFinger}}">{{item.leftFinger}}指 </text>{{item.rightAction}}
                    <text wx:if="{{item.source}}"> · 来自简谱 {{item.source}}</text>
                </text>
            </view>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
        <text class="section-title">解减字码</text>
        <view class="input-row">
            <input
                class="code-input"
                value="{{codeInput}}"
                placeholder="ad9g4 sg3 ad9g4:8."
                placeholder-class="code-placeholder"
                confirm-type="done"
                bindinput="onCodeInput"
                bindconfirm="decode"
            />
            <button class="primary-button decode-button" loading="{{decoding}}" bindtap="decode">解</button>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box code-error">{{error}}</view>

        <block wx:if="{{hasResult}}">
            <view class="divider"></view>
            <text class="muted">{{resultLine}}</text>
            <view wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="index" class="cand">
                <view class="cand-main">
                    <text class="cand-line mono">{{item.code}}</text>
                    <text wx:if="{{item.failed}}" class="cand-error">{{item.error}}</text>
                    <text wx:else class="cand-sub">{{item.stateText}}<text wx:if="{{item.tail}}"> · {{item.tail}}</text></text>
                </view>
            </view>
        </block>
    </view>

    <view class="notice">
        减字码是有损编码：一个码对应唯一的字，但同一个字可能不止一种写法。
        所以这里只做「码 → 结构」，不反推码。
    </view>
</view>
